# Oketra's Attendant's cycling {2} (CR 702.29a) and embalm {3}{W}{W} (CR 702.128a): on turn 1 Bot1 cycles it with Mana Crypt's
# {C}{C} (it is discarded and a card drawn), which puts it in the graveyard. Then it pays the embalm cost exactly with
# Black Lotus's {W}{W}{W} and two more white mana from Mox Pearls (the pool is empty right after) and exiles the card for a
# token copy of it: white, a Bird Soldier Zombie with no mana cost, a 3/3 with flying. The card stays in exile.

